     1309     define buffer buf_userobjs_temp-user-obj for userobjs_temp-user-obj .
     1310     for each buf_userobjs_temp-user-obj
     1311     on error undo, return no-apply
     1312     :
     1313       run objo-ADD
     1314         (input  buf_grp-obj-price.gop-db-num
     1315         ,input  buf_grp-obj-price.gop-id
     1316         ,input  buf_userobjs_temp-user-obj.obj-type
     1317         ,input  buf_userobjs_temp-user-obj.obj-code
     1318         ,input  0
     1319         ,input  v-cntxt-db-num
     1320         ,input  v-cntxt-userid
